OL,3,GNEWSAWatch: Drug driver banned after
OL,4,Acrashing into pole
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug-driver who crashed into a pole
OL,7,Fafter falling asleep at the wheel has
OL,8,Fbeen handed a suspended prison sentence
OL,9,Fand been banned from driving.
OL,11,FEmma Dutton, from Wallingford, drove
OL,12,Fher car into a pole on Stadhampton
OL,13,FRoad, Little Milton in Oxfordshire on 5
OL,14,FFebruary this year.
OL,16,FIn footage of the incident shared by
OL,17,FThames Valley Police, Dutton's car can
OL,18,Fbe seen failing to follow a bend in the
OL,19,Froad and instead continuing onto a
OL,20,Fgrass verge before striking the pole.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
