OL,3,GNEWSAWatch: Drug driver banned after
OL,4,Acrashing into pole
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 43-year-old was later found to be
OL,7,Fover the drug-drive limit for cocaine,
OL,8,Fand during a hearing at Oxford
OL,9,FMagistrates' Court on 8 October
OL,10,Freceived a two-year suspended prison
OL,11,Fsentence alongside a 22-month driving
OL,12,Fban.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
